        <item>
            <title>0.19.5</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 10:32:43 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1905</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.5</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Meetings get real names.</b> Once the notes are written, Jarvis names
      the meeting after what it was about, in the language you spoke, instead
      of "Meeting 10:01". Older meetings are renamed the next time Jarvis
      opens.</li>
  <li><b>"Take notes?" no longer slips away.</b> If you miss the five seconds
      (Meet turns the mic on in its waiting room), Jarvis stays in the notch
      for the rest of the call. Hover over him to bring the button back.</li>
  <li><b>Recordings stop when the call does.</b> Starting notes by hand during
      a call now stops and saves when you leave it.</li>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> after stopping a meeting by hand, the next call in the same
      app could be missed entirely.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
